{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10299","headline":"奉寄中书王舍人 · 皇甫曾","name":"奉寄中书王舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腰金载笔谒承明，至道安禅得此生。\n西掖几年纶綍贵，东山遥夜薜萝情。\n风传刻漏星河曙，月上梧桐雨露清。\n圣主好文谁爲荐，闭门空赋子虚成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}